  What:Pere,desc:the Peeroleum peer-to-peer transport floor — liveness reliability and trust admission
    Funkcion:StoryTimes
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:PereStaple,wire:canonical Peeroleum spine over loopback mock carriers — the real socket is un-Booked
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:PereTyrant
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:PereProof
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:Peregrination
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:PereReborn,wire:reconnect-epoch fix over one loopback link — boot-detection stubbed
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:PereComplain,born:2026-07-22,desc:the protocol back-signal — an unenabled frame type draws a no_protocol complaint when the peer is ready but is held silently during the handshake startup window
  What:Repli,desc:the C** replication protocol bare — no piers no wire — fragments pumped straight from Repli_fragment into Repli_merge
    Funkcion:StoryTimes
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:RepliUpsert,born:2026-08-05,wire:no wire — a bare source and mirror in one world,desc:the upsert law — mint then self-matching resend then overwrite-only-carried-keys then absence-is-not-deletion then op delete and dupe
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:RepliSplit,born:2026-08-05,wire:no wire — a bare source and mirror in one world,desc:the spine locates itself — many to one stays many — an undeclared mainkey splits visibly and never silently merges
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:RepliShadow,born:2026-08-05,wire:no wire — a bare source and mirror in one world,desc:the seem experiment — identity observed from a sent-shadow with no schema — a shadowless negative control splits beside it
  What:Swarm,desc:the social sharing layer — signed invites reciprocal grants revocation and portable accounts
    Funkcion:StoryTimes
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmStaple,wire:identity and grant crypto at the model layer — no wire
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmWire,wire:the handshake over the loopback Peeroleum spine — mock carriers not a socket
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmSteal,wire:one key in many places at the model layer — no wire
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmInvite,wire:QR redeem over the in-process mail wire — no socket
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmDoor,wire:first-contact door over deterministic mock stations — NOT the real websocket
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmGot,wire:reachable-music tally over the mail wire — no socket
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmPolicy,wire:door ttl policy over the mail wire — no socket
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:Swarmation
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmShare,wire:live-share keying over two loopback links — no relay
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmChain,born:2026-07-22,desc:the re-assignable ReInvite chain — one invite threads A—B—C—D and the tip not the issuer grants each newcomer capped at the embedded Feature
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmBlotter,born:2026-07-22,desc:the one-time serial SHEET — a printed blotter of numbered tickets each a single-use invite torn once and refused a replay plus the legacy link door-parse
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmSpoof,born:2026-07-22,desc:the prepub-forgery teeth — a hostile hello may declare a victim's address while holding its own key and self-signed grant so the door binds the routing prepub to the verified pub or refuses the seal
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:SwarmDisk
