  What:Vyto,desc:the power-diagram foam glass — cells cut and sprung from the model with no cytoscape
    Funkcion:StoryTimes
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoStaple,born:2026-07-20,desc:the glass commissioned beside a run — its mirror and spool turn
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoCell,born:2026-07-20,desc:dosed cogs cut into distinct cells — express sizes solve seats and calm pins one
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoMitosis,born:2026-07-20,desc:a dosed flora cuts into cells then grows and a genus goes extinct
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoRadio,born:2026-07-20,desc:a six-genus tuner flora drifts and the hand pins a cell then eases it free
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoTandem,born:2026-07-20,desc:two watchers ride one gear then one decommissions — the era-guarded multi-handler watch
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoFreeze,born:2026-07-20,desc:the spool culls to its cap while green and freezes on a failed run
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoSeek,born:2026-07-20,desc:a step pip seeks to the moment carrying that step_n — the whichever-glass seek shim
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoCrest,born:2026-07-22,desc:the distiller at the fold station says the oracle rows and assigns every supersession its counted door
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoWeb,born:2026-07-27,desc:the foam organs — gang cleaves a crowded row relate weaves flow edges and a focus swells its cell
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoFold,born:2026-07-27,desc:the fold engine — the budget scales with area and the ladder folds the least-dominant family first shielding the focus
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoBunch,born:2026-07-27,desc:the relate attraction — kin cells pulled together rest closer joined than severed
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoFoam,born:2026-07-27,desc:the seven algebra laws in one pass — distillation type-scale supersession floor nested cut composition and the read-back contract — no glass
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoBreathe,born:2026-07-27,desc:a relation lifts size — a cell tied by shared meaning is a bigger cell so importance is graph-global not merely local
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoNest,born:2026-07-27,desc:the scope recursion — a nested glass cuts each cell into its own childrens cells to any depth so a cluster of UI bits nests as scopes
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoCrush
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoNestRest
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoMemo,born:2026-07-30,brand_new:1,desc:a settled glass cuts no new walls under forced repaints — the per-scope wall memo and its cut counter
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoNeed,born:2026-07-30,brand_new:1,desc:the browser measures the widget and the diagram honors the box — a fat label lifts its cell while the plain commission keeps the bare dose box
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoDepth,born:2026-07-30,brand_new:1,desc:six children tile a small parent with no crowd-out — child radii scale to the parent share of the frame
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:VytoOrchestra,born:2026-08-09,desc:the canonical demo — foam cut and nested bag and kin weave and loose strays then a live re-weave a focus swell a pose flip and a departure escort in one world
  What:Musu,desc:the music-piracy streaming platform — the rastock racast raterm pipeline of Radio_todo
    Funkcion:StoryTimes
    What:mostly,desc:the stuff we mostly do as jamsend the music app — the rastock racast raterm pipeline on real tracks
      What:the wire cut,desc:the CANONICAL paged shape end to end — a Mag crosses as one husk then warm-starts pulls stages and plays back — MusuBuddy the social session and MusuMag the wire proof
