        Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:MusuLossy,needsFSA:1,born:2026-07-26,desc:the %Original vs %Lossy grade split at census — a compressed opus or mp3 source lands %Lossy with its title read from the codec headers while a lossless wav lands %Original — and the graded chunks reassemble byte-faithfully into a file left on disk
